<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Welcome to SpeakUpMic</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #0f0f1a; color: #e0e0e0; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; background: #1a1a2e; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #06b6d4); padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; }
    .body p { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.6; }
    .cta { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #06b6d4); color: #fff; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin: 16px 0; }
    .features { background: #0f0f1a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .feature { display: flex; align-items: center; margin: 10px 0; color: #a0a0b0; }
    .feature::before { content: "✓"; color: #06b6d4; margin-right: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 32px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to SpeakUpMic! 🚀</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>You've taken the first step on your confidence journey. Here's what awaits you:</p>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">Daily missions to build real-world confidence</div>
        <div class="feature">Fear ladder system based on exposure therapy</div>
        <div class="feature">Speech practice with AI-powered feedback</div>
        <div class="feature">XP, levels, badges and streak rewards</div>
        <div class="feature">Personal AI coach — Atlas</div>
      </div>
      <p>Open the app and complete your onboarding to get your personalized plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; 2026 SpeakUpMic by ThinkFeat &bull; info@thinkfeat.com
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
